xroad-metrics-collector (1.5.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Update dependencies
  * Bump minimum required Python version to 3.10
  * Bump suggested MongoDB versions to 7.0 (Ubuntu 22.04) / 8.0 (Ubuntu 24.04)
  * Add support for Ubuntu 24.04, drop support for Ubuntu 20.04
  * Add "srcServer" field to raw messages collection to store message origin
